@ChildAssessmentApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5016

### Get all sections with questions
GET {{ChildAssessmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/assessments/sections
Accept: application/json

### Import sample questions
POST {{ChildAssessmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/assessments/questions/import-sample
Accept: application/json

### Get all questions
GET {{ChildAssessmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/assessments/questions
Accept: application/json

### Get questions by section
GET {{ChildAssessmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/assessments/questions?sectionId=1
Accept: application/json

### Get question categories
GET {{ChildAssessmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/assessments/questions/categories
Accept: application/json

### Get milestone levels
GET {{ChildAssessmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/assessments/questions/milestone-levels
Accept: application/json

### Create a child
POST {{ChildAssessmentApi_HostAddress}}/api/assessments/children
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "أحمد محمد",
  "dateOfBirth": "2020-01-15T00:00:00Z"
}

###
